      "kind": "idiom",
      "subject": "תמול שלשום",
      "rationale": "K'a literally to, 'dɔgɔkun \/ dɔgɔkun tɛmɛ' — Heburukan na, o bɛ fɔ waati kɔrɔ bɛɛ ye (heretofore)."
